    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can you help me draft a professional email to one of our suppliers? We got an invoice from BASF for the resin shipment that came in yesterday, but the quantity billed doesn't match what we actually received in the warehouse. I need to ask them to explain why there's a discrepancy and request a credit memo for the difference. Thanks.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
